# Extra secrets this family's canary repo must carry, beyond the
# RELEASE_TOKEN every canary needs. `release-core admin canary init`
# converges them (sourced from the operator's canonical auth dir, the
# same sources install-release-secrets reads) — fixture metadata, never
# part of the seed.
#
# Cert-only Apple signing (arthur-debert/release#587 OQ3): every canary
# cut exercises sign-mac for real. The ASC_* notarization trio is
# deliberately ABSENT — and forbidden on the repo, like the publish
# trio — so Apple's 5-15 min notarytool round-trip stays out of the
# pre-cut loop (rust-cli.yml skips notarization when no ASC key is set).
APPLE_CERTIFICATE_P12_BASE64
APPLE_CERTIFICATE_PASSWORD
